      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{59e59c1cda46f215cddef5f6|full_name}: yeah, that's all pretty cool. I like the intro channel in the discord. This would give people a good way to have more info about themselves. We're also working on some nametag and reputation stuff that could possibly tie in.",
