      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was about to suggest the same, before seeing this. +1 from me.\n\nMy motivation for wanting this, in particular is that it would provide a bit more to help memorise friends by, than just their name and a face that may well change every minute. I've found that with an ever growing friends list I keep seeing names with unfamiliar avatars, and struggling to remember where or how I met them, or even confusing them with different people. I've talked to others who have expressed the same problem. Even a little bit of persistent profile info could really help.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
